            <ArticleTitle>Pitfalls in the evaluation of shortness of breath.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>163-81, ix</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.emc.2009.09.011</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article illustrates the challenges practitioners face evaluating shortness of breath, a common emergency department complaint. Through a series of patient encounters, pitfalls in the evaluation of shortness of breath are reviewed and discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
